{"id":47448,"date":"2025-12-27T20:13:46","date_gmt":"2025-12-27T19:13:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47448"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:31:04","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:31:04","slug":"pirilampos-night-run-bajouca","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/pirilampos-night-run-bajouca\/","title":{"rendered":"Pirilampos Night Run Bajouca 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Pirilampos Night Run Bajouca 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>11\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos Pirilampos Night Run Bajouca 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>12 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na carism\u00e1tica freguesia da <strong>Bajouca<\/strong>, no concelho e distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Promovida pelo Departamento de Atletismo do <strong>Grupo Alegre e Unido \u2013 Bajouca<\/strong>, esta prova noturna alia atletismo, esp\u00edrito de aventura e cultura popular numa celebra\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva iluminada.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com o programa a iniciar-se \u00e0s <strong>19:30<\/strong> para os escal\u00f5es jovens e a prova principal de <strong>6 km<\/strong> a arrancar em formato contra-rel\u00f3gio \u00e0s <strong>20:30<\/strong> (partida na <strong>Igreja da Bajouca<\/strong> e chegada \u00e0 <strong>Pista de Atletismo \/ Campo das Pedras<\/strong>), os participantes enfrentam obst\u00e1culos e surpresas ao longo de um tra\u00e7ado misto que atravessa as famosas olarias tradicionais de barro da regi\u00e3o, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de frontal\/lanterna.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 19:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; wi