between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada Noturna<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Pirilampos Caminhada 6K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 20:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 11.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31 Jul)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15 Ago)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04 Set)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Provas Jovens<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Pirilampos Kids (Benj\/Inf\/Inic\/Juv)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 19:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 15 Ago:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15 Ago)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Fase:<\/strong> 2.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04 Set)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a prova Pirilampos Night Run Bajouca 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de setembro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 19:30 na Igreja da Bajouca e meta na Pista de Atletismo do Campo das Pedras, em Bajouca (Leiria).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o formato contra-rel\u00f3gio da corrida dos 6 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas partem em pequenos grupos de 5 participantes com intervalos de 20 segundos a partir das 20:30, agrupados por ordem de ritmo para reduzir ultrapassagens no circuito.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio algum equipamento especial para correr \u00e0 noite?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de lanterna frontal (ou de m\u00e3o) e pe\u00e7as com elementos refletores para garantir a visibilidade e seguran\u00e7a ao longo do percurso.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os percursos e dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra escal\u00f5es jovens a partir das 19:30, a Corrida Noturna de 6 km com obst\u00e1culos surpresa e a Caminhada Noturna de 6 km com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 20:35.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o percurso cultural pela Bajouca?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O trajeto de 6 km percorre o centro hist\u00f3rico da Bajouca e inclui passagens pelo interior e envolvente das tradicionais olarias de cer\u00e2mica da vila.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Pirilampos Night Run Bajouca 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Igreja da Bajouca e Pista de Atletismo (Campo das Pedras)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Leiria\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Grupo Alegre e Unido \u2013 Bajouca (Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a prova Pirilampos Night Run Bajouca 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de setembro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 19:30 na Igreja da Bajouca e meta na Pista de Atletismo do Campo das Pedras, em Bajouca (Leiria).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o formato contra-rel\u00f3gio da corrida dos 6 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os atletas partem em pequenos grupos de 5 participantes com intervalos de 20 segundos a partir das 20:30, agrupados por ordem de ritmo para reduzir ultrapassagens no circuito.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio algum equipamento especial para correr \u00e0 noite?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de lanterna frontal (ou de m\u00e3o) e pe\u00e7as com elementos refletores para garantir a visibilidade e seguran\u00e7a ao longo do percurso.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os percursos e dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento integra escal\u00f5es jovens a partir das 19:30, a Corrida Noturna de 6 km com obst\u00e1culos surpresa e a Caminhada Noturna de 6 km com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 20:35.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o percurso cultural pela Bajouca?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O trajeto de 6 km percorre o centro hist\u00f3rico da Bajouca e inclui passagens pelo interior e envolvente das tradicionais olarias de cer\u00e2mica da vila.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66151,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,478,624],"event_type_2":[38,727],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47448","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-bajouca-leiria","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-leiria","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_3-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/pirilampos-night-run-bajouca-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47448","targetHints":{"allow":["GET